                        "review": "This game is all about doging various objects with mouse or keyboard. If you like that kind of games than this is maybe for you but I don't recommend it. \n\nPros:\n[list]\n[*] many levels\n[*] difficult\n[*] co-operative\n[/list]\n\nCons:\n[list]\n[*] monotone\n[*] background music is somewhat boring\n[*] no effects at all\n[*] ugly graphics (this kind of graphics is used in pre 90s). I personally don't care much for graphics if gameplay surpass it but here is not that case\n[/list]\n\nVerdict: another unity crap. Hide it or delete.\n\nCheers!",
